ls. Build a qualified pipeline and work alongside experienced Growth Managers on campaign setup, performance analysis, and optimization decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Days 61–90:</strong> Close your first advertiser partnerships and own their initial campaign launches. Identify performance improvements, make optimization recommendations, and secure budget increases where results support scaling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Beyond 90 days:</strong> Build a repeatable record of winning advertisers and growing their spend. Take on larger opportunities and contribute to Almedia’s commercial growth.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What You’ll Bring 💡</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A record of winning business.</strong> You've acquired customers, negotiated agreements, and delivered measurable revenue results in sales, business development, or a commercially focused growth role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The drive to create opportunities.</strong> You're comfortable opening doors, reaching decision-makers, and building a pipeline through your own initiative.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A consultative sales approach.</strong> You ask sharp questions, understand advertiser priorities, and connect your proposal to a clear business outcome.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Campaign optimization skills.</strong> You can read performance data, diagnose why a campaign is underperforming, and propose changes to improve delivery and returns. You're comfortable forming a hypothesis, running a test, and deciding whether to scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The ability to learn a technical product.</strong> You want to understand how Almedia works in practice. You can learn its tools and explain campaign mechanics clearly to advertisers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Confidence with performance metr