p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Engineer with AI, responsibly. </strong>Use agentic workflows and AI tooling every day while you stay accountable for architecture, security and quality. You'll also help shape how our team builds with AI.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build the new and improve the existing. </strong>Your time splits roughly evenly between new product capabilities and modernising an established codebase. Every area you touch should be better when you leave it.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work beyond your team's walls. </strong>Spot dependencies with our other teams early, raise risks before they block delivery, and keep stakeholders informed.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deliver as a team. </strong>Join four talented engineers who share ownership. You'll work in four-month terms with two-week sprints, keep rituals lean, and adjust scope when reality changes.</p></li></ul><h2></h2><h2><strong>WHAT YOU'LL GET IN RETURN</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The freedom, trust, and tools to do what you love and make an impact in a purpose-driven company, committed to doing genuine good in the digital world</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enjoy a high degree of flexibility with tailored working hours, choice of work location, and benefits that support your lifestyle, health, and family needs</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join a secure, future-focused role in a dynamic scale-up positioned to make a major impact in the rapidly expanding Security &amp; Compliance market</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow along expert or leadership paths with support from employee accelerator programs, bi-annual feedback cycles, and a personal training bu