ntial partners and prepare outreach.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>What you bring</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ve owned external relationships and can point to a concrete commercial result, such as qualified referrals, a joint launch or merchant adoption.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re comfortable starting relationships from scratch, leading conversations with senior decision-makers and getting both sides to agree on what happens next.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can turn an agreement into a launch, with clear owners, deadlines and regular follow-up across teams and companies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re comfortable tracking results and deciding where to focus your time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re fluent in German and comfortable leading commercial conversations and writing follow-ups in German. You also communicate clearly in English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in partnerships, business development or a related commercial role is valuable. Familiarity with Shopify, logistics, e-commerce or B2B SaaS is a plus.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>What we offer</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully remote, with regular team meetups</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Responsibility from day one, with the chance to build and lead our partner network across DACH and even broader markets</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Hiring process</strong></h3><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intro call (15 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep dive (60 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Call with our founders (30 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Paid trial day</p></li></ol><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","rem