pic's Claude, and we also have Codex subscriptions you can use.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Just <strong>building, shipping, improving</strong>.<br /><br /><br /><strong>You will:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build <strong>high-impact features</strong> used daily by real businesses</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ship fast using <strong>TypeScript </strong>throughout the whole stack<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dive into <strong>Node.js </strong>backends and handle data with<strong> PostgreSQL </strong>and<strong> Prisma</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn complex workflows into <strong>clean, intuitive interfaces with React and Tailwind</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with product and design — <strong>no layers, no handoffs</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">See your code in production <strong>within days, not months</strong></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>And if you want more:</strong><br />Work with<strong> Rust </strong>to extend our Simulation that predicts the future of our customers project<br /><br /><br />This is not a narrow role. It’s a <strong>playground for builders</strong>. <br /><br /><br /><strong>You’ll thrive here if you…</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Love <strong>turning complexity into simplicity</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Care about <strong>UX as much as clean code</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prefer <strong>ownership over instructions</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Move fast, learn fast, and <strong>fix things instead of debating them</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Actually want to <strong>build</strong>, not just talk about building</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you need perfect specs and slow timelines — this isn’t it.<br />If you want to