style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a Founding Account Executive to own and grow DACH for Condukt, by owning and closing complex, high-value enterprise deals across financial services.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In this role, you will lead the full sales cycle, from early discovery and solution design through negotiation and close, working with high-growth fintechs. You’ll operate as a trusted advisor to senior decision-makers, helping them navigate complex compliance challenges while unlocking growth with Condukt’s real-time identity and AI-powered platform.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As an early-stage, fast-growing company, we value people who take ownership, move with urgency, and are excited to help build both a category-defining product and a repeatable enterprise sales motion. You’ll work closely with Account Management, Product, Engineering, and Leadership to shape how we sell, who we sell to, and how we win.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you thrive in consultative enterprise sales, enjoy solving hard problems with customers, and want meaningful influence over strategy and execution, this role is for you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Owning DACH</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is our first role dedicated to DACH:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Carry the DACH number, from pipeline and forecast through to close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Open the territory from scratch and land our first local reference customers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sell in German, and feed what you hear in the market back to Product</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll do:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the full enterprise sales cycle for new strategic customers in DACH, from first conversation through contract negotiation and close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead complex, multi-stakeholder deal processes (6+ months), navigating procurement, legal, security, and compliance reviews</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders across Risk &amp; Compliance, Product, Operations, and C-suite, positioning Condukt as a long-term strategic partner</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run discovery-led, consultative sales processes that deeply understand customer workflows, regulatory constraints, and success metrics</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Craft and deliver executive-level and technical presentations, tailoring value propositions to diverse audiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely across teams to ensure smooth handoffs, successful implementations, and expansion readiness post-close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with Product and Engineering to shape roadmap priorities, providing structured feedback from the field</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the development of scalable sales playbooks, pricing frameworks, and go-to-market strategy for DACH</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Condukt at industry events, conferences, and customer forums in DACH</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you bring:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Native or professional German, plus fluent English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience closing complex enterprise SaaS deals with financial institutions, fintechs, or regulated enterprises</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong track record of exceeding quota in long, consultative sales cycles (6+ months) with multi-six- and seven-figure ACVs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to navigate large, matrixed organizations and influence multiple decision-makers and economic buyers</p