velopment. A key part of the role involves owning pages and components in our client monorepo, which provides shared implementations for Web, iOS, and Android, built with React Native and Next.js and backed by GraphQL.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll be working closely with product managers, designers, and stakeholders, so strong stakeholder management skills are essential. We value engineers who are not only technically strong but also comfortable driving conversations, aligning with business needs, and advocating for the customer at every step.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">To support your mission team in quickly iterating and gaining insights into our customers, you will focus on designing, launching, and iterating on A/B experiments while continuously improving our codebase, systems, and processes. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will aim to design and develop efficient, scalable solutions and prioritize mentoring other team members and participating in the hiring process.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work involves technologies such as React.js, React Native, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, and GraphQL, as well as exposure to Java and Spring Boot.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set team-wide standards and vision for responsible AI adoption, leverage AI tooling to accelerate development workflows and productivity, and drive measurable improvements in both product development speed and quality by strategically integrating AI into daily engineering practice.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who you are: </strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6+ years of software development experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expertise in web application development using component-based frameworks</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High proficiency in TypeScript</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience designing architecture and deployment of web