 style="min-height:1.5em">SQL or spreadsheet modeling skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to sales compensation, revenue recognition, or partner and reseller billing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience at a high-growth company where you helped stand up a process from scratch</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Our values</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Trust: We do the right thing, even when no one is looking, and even when it’s hard. When we screw up, we take accountability, fully and completely. We act in such a way that if all of our actions were completely visible to our customers, we would be proud.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customer Obsession: Our entire business is designed to ensure every agent built on Sierra succeeds, and that we are accountable to our customers and their success. We do whatever it takes to make our customers successful, and we go the extra mile in how we show up as a partner with unreasonable hospitality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Craftsmanship: A great company is the aggregation of thousands of things done well. As they say, “how you do anything is how you do everything”. Most important is craftsmanship in building agents that are so great that people thank them at the end of a call. That’s the standard.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intensity: We operate with urgency, and we want to win. We are never complacent. We fight to win every deal, big or small, using the full force of the company. And when we fail, we talk about it openly and without blame so we succeed the next time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Family: We know that balance and intensity are compatible, and we model it in our actions and processes. We work hard, and turn on the afterburners when needed. But we pick up our parents at the airport when they’re visiting from out of town. We go to our kids’ events. And we show up for one another, in moments of celebration and hardship.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What we offer</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We want our benefits to reflect our values and offer the following to full-time employees:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible (unlimited) paid time off</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Medical, dental, and vision benefits for you and your family</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Life insurance and disability benefits</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Retirement plan dependent on country of employment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Parental leave</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fertility and family building benefits</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lunch, as well as delicious snacks and coffee to keep you energized when working onsite</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Discretionary benefit stipend giving people the ability to spend where it matters most</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Free alphorn lessons</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">These benefits are further detailed in Sierra's policies, may vary by region and employment type, and are subject to change at any time, consistent with the terms of any applicable compensation or benefits plans. Eligible full-time employees can participate in Sierra's equity plans subject to the terms of the applicable plans and policies.</p><h2><strong>Be you, with us</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're working to bring the transformative power of AI to every organization in the world. To do so, it is important to us that the diversity of our employees represents the diversity of our customers. We believe that our work and culture are better when we encourage, support, and respect different skills and experiences represented within our team. We encourage you to apply through the link on this page even if your experience doesn't precisely match the job description.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sierra is a proud equal oppor