<p data-path-to-node="11,4,0"><strong data-path-to-node="11,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Analytical &amp; Innovative Thinking:</strong> Highly analytical mindset with strong capability to interpret data and turn findings into strategic commercial recommendations.</p>
