t:1.5em"><strong>Adoption</strong>: run campaigns to increase usage of Parallel across our customers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product feedback</strong>: share what you see in the field and work with Product on levers to increase usage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Management</strong>: manage two experienced people, set the framework and priorities, help them grow and structure the team as the number of accounts increases.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>Who you are</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have 3 to 5 years of experience in Customer Success, with your own B2B customer portfolio.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have already managed people, even an intern, and you have the credibility to lead two experienced people.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have already set up NPS campaigns and done account monitoring: you know which indicators you track and how you detect an account in trouble.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You make decisions on your own on an account and raise the alarm when a metric drops.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You want to keep working directly on accounts on top of managing: this is not a pure management role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A plus: experience with key account portfolios.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>Our values</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Play to Win</strong>: we're not here to just take part, deliver something "good enough" or simply enjoy the startup ride. We want to win. That means caring about results, moving fast and bringing the right intensity when it matters.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High Trust, High Standards</strong>: trust is our starting point. If you join us, it's because we believe you can own your scope and make good decisions. We don't want a company built on approvals, control and micromanagement. But trust comes with accountability: the more freedom you have, the higher the bar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Low Ego, Hands-On</strong>: at Parallel, no one is above the work. No title, seniority or past success exempts anyone from getting involved in the actual work. Leading means taking responsibility, not distancing yourself from execution.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Don't Take Yourself Too Seriously</strong>: we take our mission very seriously, not ourselves. Building a company is intense. We want Parallel to remain a place where people enjoy spending time together, laughing, celebrating and giving energy to others. High standards and a good atmosphere aren't opposites: we want both.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>Hiring process</strong></h1><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Call with the Hiring Team (30 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Call with Clémentine, Head of Ops and your future manager (30 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An afternoon at our office to present your case and meet the founders (2 hours)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reference check</p></li></ol><h1><strong>Why join us?</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A role to build</strong>: you lay the foundations of customer success at Parallel (metrics, campaigns, team organisation).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A key role</strong>: customer success weighs heavily on Parallel's reputation, and you are the right hand of the Head of Ops on this topic.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real traction</strong>: seed and Series A ($20M with Index Ventures) closed in less than a year, more than 800 clients and a team of over 30 people.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strong investors and founders</strong>: Index Ventures, Y Combinator, Hexa, Frst, Kima Ventures, Better Angle and the CEO of Mistral AI; founders who come from