&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/proton/mobile-product-engineer-paris-373202","tags":["Product Engineering - Mobile"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1795535738},{"slug":"project-manager-h-f-paris-166701","company_name":"Marsorobotics","title":"Project Manager H/F","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">At Marso, as a <strong>Deployment Project Manager</strong>, you will lead the deployment of Marso robots at customer sites, from contract signature to acceptance and handover to Run &amp; Support. You are the single point of contact for the customer during deployment, and you make sure every project is delivered on time, on budget, and at the promised performance level.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Responsibilities</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take over signed projects from the Sales Engineer and check scope, assumptions, prerequisites and acceptance criteria.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and manage the deployment plan: schedule, resources, budget, risks and dependencies (site, infrastructure, IT/WMS integration and robot availability).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be the customer’s main point of contact: kick-off, steering committees, progress reports and change management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate internal teams (deployment engineers, technicians, Engineering, Intelligent Robotics, Supply) and external partners on site.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run site readiness, installation, commissioning and ramp-up.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run acceptance tests against the agreed performance criteria and secure formal customer sign-off.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hand the site over to Run &amp; Support with complete documentation: configuration, known issues, SLAs and contacts.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Profile</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">4 to 7 years of experience in project management for industrial or logistics deployments, ideally in warehouse automation, robotics or material handling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of delivering complex on-site projects end to end with real customer and budget accountability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good understanding of warehouse operations and technical environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong command of project management methods and tools: planning, risk management, budget tracking and reporting.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organized, rigorous and hands-on, you are comfortable spending a lot of time on site.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent French and English, you are willing to travel frequently across Europe.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nice to have: experience with AMR/AGV or palletization deployments, knowledge of WMS/WCS, site safety training.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We are committed to building a diverse and inclusive team and encourage all qualified candidates to apply, regardless of background.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Chez Marso, en tant que <strong>Chef·fe de Projet Déploiement</strong>, vous piloterez le déploiement des robots Marso sur les sites clients, de la signature du contrat jusqu’à la réception et au passage en Run &amp; Support. Vous êtes l’interlocuteur unique du client pendant le déploiement et vous garantissez que chaque projet est livré dans les délais, dans le budget et au niveau de performance promis.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Missions</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reprendre les projets