<li>MLOps background: CI/CD, model deployment, monitoring/observability, IaC, and workflow orchestration (e.g. Prefect, Weights &amp; Biases, or equivalents).</li>
<li>Familiarity with backend systems principles, including API serving, containerization, distributed compute, security considerations.</li>

<div><strong>Leadership &amp; Collaboration</strong></div>

