seren over hun warmtepompsysteem.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Feedbackloop: </strong>Je koppelt bevindingen uit het veld direct terug aan de productontwikkelaars in Den Haag om de volgende generatie warmtepompen nóg beter te maken.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Wie zoeken wij?</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>De Expert: </strong>Je hebt uitgebreide ervaring in het servicen van CV-installaties, koeltechniek of warmtepompen. Je leest technische schema’s als een krant.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Analytisch: </strong>Je vindt het leuk om diep in de data en de techniek te duiken om de oorzaak van een probleem te vinden.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mentor-rol: </strong>Je krijgt er energie van om jouw kennis over te dragen aan minder ervaren collega's en hen te helpen groeien.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Opleiding &amp; Certificering: </strong>Een afgeronde MBO-4 opleiding (Installatietechniek/Elektrotechniek).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Communicatie: </strong>Je kunt complexe techniek simpel uitleggen aan zowel een klant als aan een meer junior collega.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Wat bieden wij jou?</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sleutelpositie: </strong>Een verantwoordelijke baan in de frontlinie van de energietransitie bij een ambitieuze scale-up.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ontwikkeling: </strong>Mogelijkheid om door te groeien naar Field Lead of Technisch Specialist binnen de R&amp;D afdeling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Topmateriaal: </strong>Een luxe servicebus met de modernste meetinstrumenten en gereedschap.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cultuur: </strong>Werken bij een innovatieve werkgever met veel vrijheid, korte lijnen en een jong, gedreven team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Arbeidsvoorwaarden: </strong>Een salaris dat recht doet aan jouw expertise en senioriteit (€3500-€5000), goede pensioenregeling en 38 vakantiedagen.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Over DeWarmte</strong><br /><br />Wij geloven dat verduurzaming makkelijker én slimmer kan. Met onze warmtepompen bieden we een innovatieve oplossing voor de Nederlandse huishoudens. Ons serviceteam is cruciaal voor het vertrouwen van de klant in deze nieuwe techniek.<br /></p><hr><p>Compensation: €3.5K – €5K per month</p><ul><li> • €3.5K – €5K per month</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/dewarmte/hoofd-servicemonteur-warmtepompen-the-netherlands-153273","tags":["Service"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"The Netherlands","created_at":1795567211},{"slug":"senior-adviseur-duurzaamheid-en-business-development-utrecht-205337","company_name":"Movares","title":"Senior-adviseur duurzaamheid en business development","description":"<h3><strong>Jouw impact bij Movares</strong></h3><p>Jij maakt duurzaamheid concreet, creëert nieuwe kansen en vergroot de maatschappelijke impact van complexe projecten.</p><h3><strong>Dit ga je doen bij Movares</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Jij adviseert opdrachtgevers over strategische duurzaamheidsvraagstukken binnen infrastructuur en de gebouwde omgeving.</p></li><li><p>Je ontwikkelt marktgerichte proposities en zet kansen om in concrete opdrachten voor het team Duurzaamheid.</p></li><li><p>Je deelt je kennis, begeleidt collega’s en vertegenwoordigt Movares tijdens congressen, seminars en branchebijeenkomsten.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Als senior-adviseur combineer je inhoudelijk advies met business development. Ongeveer 50%  van je tijd werk je aan complexe projecten rond bijvoorbeeld netcongestie, circulariteit, klimaatadaptatie, energietransitie, stikstof en natuurinclusieve ontwikkeling. Daarnaast bouw je relaties op met opdrachtgevers en partners. Je vertaalt marktontwikkelingen naar nieuwe diensten, presentaties en publicaties. Samen met de teamleider zorg je voor een gezonde werkvoorraad en verdere groei van het team.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong>Dit ben jij bij Movares</strong></h3><p>Je bent een ondernemende adviseur die inhoudelijke deskundigheid verbindt met commercieel inzicht. Je legt gemakkelijk nieuwe contacten en weet vertrouwen op te bouwen bij opdrachtgevers en partners. Met overtuigende adviezen en presentaties breng je mensen en organisaties in beweging. Ook help je collega’s graag om zich verder te ontwikkelen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Dit breng je ook mee:</p><ul><li><p>een afgeronde hbo- of wo-opleiding en minimaal zeven jaar relevante werkervaring;</p></li><li><p>aantoonbare ervaring met business development, propositieontwikkeling en het verwerven van opdrachten;</p></li><li><p>kennis van één of meer duurzaamheidsthema’s en een relevant netwerk binnen infrastructuur, overheid, energie, industrie of de gebouwde omgeving.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong>Dit krijg je bij Movares</strong></h3><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Bij Movares werk je aan opgaven die Nederland verder helpen. Tegelijk krijg je de ruimte om je werk en loopbaan in te richten op een manier die bij jou past. Met goede arbeidsvoorwaarden, veel flexibiliteit en volop mogelijkheden om je te ontwikkelen.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Een sterk fundament</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Een goede basis begint bij voorwaarden waarop je kunt rekenen:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">een salaris tussen € 4.485,- en € 7.475,- bruto per maand op basis van 40 uur;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">een flexibele pot van minimaal 15% van je jaarsalaris, inclusief vakantiegeld;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">een goede pensioenregeling bij Zwitserleven, waarbij Movares twee derde van de pensioenpremie betaalt;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">een NS Business Card voor woon-werkverkeer en zakelijke reizen. Privé profiteer je met de kaart van de dalurenkorting.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Maximaal flexibel</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Vorm een manier van werken die aansluit bij jouw leven én jouw ambities. Maak keuzes die bij jou passen:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">flexibel werken volgens ons Any Time Any Place-principe, passend bij je team, klanten en projecten;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">de mogelijkheid om twee weken per jaar te werken vanaf je vakantieadres binnen de EU;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">20 vakantiedagen bij een fulltime dienstverband, met de mogelijkheid om</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">extra dagen te kopen vanuit je flexibele pot;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">met je flexibele pot kies je wat voor jou belangrijk is, bijvoorbeeld voor extra inkomen, pensioen, een fiets, bedrijfsfitness, verduurzaming van je woning of het aflossen van je studieschuld;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">€ 750 budget per vijf jaar om je thuiswerkplek goed in te richten;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><span style="color:#121317">€ 2,45 netto thuiswerkvergoeding per thuiswerkdag.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Veel ontwikkelmogelijkheden</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Ontwikkel een loopbaan die past bij jouw talenten en ambities. Kies jouw eigen pad:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">ruimte om je expertise, ambitie en loopbaan verder te ontwikkelen;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">leren door te doen, samen met ervaren collega's en met gebruik van een breed aanbod aan ontwikkelmogelijkheden;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">de kans om actief kennis te delen en mee te bouwen aan de toekomst van ons vakgebied.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Samen groeien</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Deel mee in de waarde die we samen creëren en de groei van onze organisatie. Samen voor succes:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">je flexibele pot groeit mee met de resultaten van Movares;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">een winstdeling met een doelbedrag van 5% van je bruto jaarsalaris, afhankelijk van de resultaten;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><span style="color:#121317">en de mogelijkheid tot participeren in de waardeontwikkeling van Movares door middel van aankoop van phantom aandelen.</span></p></li></ul><h3><strong>Jouw team bij Movares</strong></h3><p>Je wordt onderdeel van het team Duurzaamheid. Dit groeiende team werkt aan actuele vraagstukken rond energie, circulariteit, klimaatadaptatie, biodiversiteit en CO₂-reductie. De adviseurs ondersteunen opdrachtgevers bij duurzame keuzes binnen infrastructuur, mobiliteit, energie en de gebouwde omgeving.</p><p>De komende jaren wil het team zijn marktpositie en maatschappelijke impact verder vergroten. Jij helpt daarbij door inhoudelijke expertise te verbinden met nieuwe klantvragen en commerciële kansen. Als inhoudelijk boegbeeld open je deuren, ontwikkel je nieuwe opdrachten en betrek je minder ervaren adviseurs bij projecten en klanttrajecten.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/movares/senior-adviseur-duurzaamheid-en-business-development-utrecht-205337","tags":["Rail: Businessontwikkeling"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Nederland","created_at":1795566698},{"slug":"senior-seo-geo-manager-utrecht-57850","company_name":"Interrail B.V.","title":"Senior SEO & GEO Manager","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Who we are</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">We believe travel can create Citizens of the World. When people cross Europe slowly, by train, they come back more curious, more open and better able to understand people unlike themselves.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">With colleagues from more than 50 countries, our diversity sparks curiosity, insight and a culture of openness, which is essential to understanding our travellers and one another.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Three values connect everyone at Interrail: we lead with our purpose, we own our impact, and we choose for growth.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">We work in a hybrid way, from our office in Utrecht and our homes across the Netherlands.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Who we’re looking for</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Someone who can shape how travellers discover Interrail, whether they’re typing into a search engine or asking an AI assistant to plan their trip. Exploring Europe by rail is one of the most transformative ways to travel, and there’s a big, untapped opportunity to make it even easier. With SEO and GEO, you’ll help travellers get inspired, plan and book their next rail adventure with an Interrail Pass in fewer steps.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Also, it’s good to know that the team has agreed to meet in the office every Tuesday and Thursday, so you’ll be expected to be in the office on these days to work side by side with your colleagues.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What you’ll be doing</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">You’ll be joining the Growth team (in a nutshell: the people who turn traveller curiosity into journeys booked), reporting to our E-Commerce Lead.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">You’ll own the end-to-end SEO and GEO strategy, so that Interrail is found, cited and recommended wherever travellers research rail travel in Europe. Working across content, product, engineering and PR/brand, you’ll turn search and AI visibility insight into meaningful, measurable growth.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Strategy and leadership</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Own and scale a unified SEO and GEO strategy and roadmap, aligned to commercial goals across our priority markets.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Prioritise investment across markets and languages based on search demand, commercial opportunity and local traveller needs.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Be our internal expert on how AI is changing travel discovery, embedding SEO and GEO thinking across marketing, content, PR/brand and product.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Partner with engineering, content and product to get the right work prioritised and shipped.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Technical SEO and architecture</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Own technical SEO for our large, complex site and set the technical roadmap with product and content.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Lead our SEO architecture: hreflang at scale, domain and subfolder strategy, and localisation quality across languages.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Make sure search engines and AI systems can access and understand the site, with the right structured data and clear, consistent information on passes, pricing and eligibility.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Own our crawler access policy for AI bots together with legal and engineering, balancing visibility against content protection.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>GEO</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Own our GEO strategy and roadmap: how we earn mentions, citations and recommendations across markets and languages.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Build our GEO measurement framework, tracking brand presence, citation share, share of voice against competitors and sentiment.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Spot recurring inaccuracies in AI-generated answers, fix them at the source with the relevant teams and track whether accuracy improves.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Partner with PR, partnerships and social to strengthen the off-site signals AI models rely on, from trusted travel publications to community presence and review platforms.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Measure and attribute AI-referred traffic and conversions, and run structured tests to build repeatable GEO playbooks.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Assess emerging opportunities, such as AI agents that plan and book travel, and advise on what Interrail needs to be ready.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Content and topical authority</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Shape content strategy and topical authority across destinations, routes, guides and inspiration, balancing discovery with pass and booking intent.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Make sure our content performs in both search results and AI answers, with clear factual structure and original rail expertise worth citing.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Be the SEO and GEO advisor to the content team, building a shared roadmap that connects visibility opportunity to editorial output.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Set and govern content quality standards (briefs, structure, internal linking, E-E-A-T) and upskill the team in SEO and GEO best practice.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Identify gaps, cannibalisation and refresh opportunities, and advise on what to create, update, consolidate or retire.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Measurement and reporting</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraph">Forecast organic and AI-driven performance, set KPIs across both, and report clearly to senior stakeholders.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What success looks like</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Non-brand searches make up a growing share of organic traffic and revenue across our priority markets.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">A GEO measurement framework is live, and our citation share and share of voice in AI answers are improving against key competitors.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">The SEO and GEO roadmap is agreed with product, engineering and content and delivered as planned, including website and CMS changes that launch without loss of organic visibility.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Recurring inaccuracies about passes, pricing and eligibility in AI answers are identified, fixed at the source and measurably reduced.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What we’re looking for</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Here’s what will help you in this role. If you don’t match every point, we’d still love to hear from you.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">In terms of your experience and skills:</p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal">Demonstrated experience leading SEO strategy across content and technical, ideally in travel, e-commerce or a large content or marketplace environment.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Hands-on GEO experience, with examples of your approach, results, measurement limitations and the decisions that followed.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">A working understanding of how AI search experiences select and cite sources, and how that differs from traditional ranking.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">A strong track record in international and multilingual SEO at scale.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">A solid technical foundation, including structured data, and the ability to influence engineering roadmaps.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Outstanding cross-functional collaboration: you align teams around a shared roadmap and take initiatives from idea to launch without direct authority, reviewing results together and applying the learnings.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">A data-driven, commercial mindset: comfortable forecasting, sizing opportunity, attributing impact in a maturing channel and presenting to leadership.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">A test-and-learn mindset, comfortable building new capabilities in a fast-changing environment.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Experience partnering closely with content, editorial, PR or brand teams.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Fluency with the core toolset: Google Search Console, GA4, an SEO platform such as Semrush or Ahrefs, a crawler such as Screaming Frog, log-analysis tools and GEO tracking tools.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Fluent English; another European language, ideally German, French, Italian or Spanish, is beneficial to have.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Our offer</strong></p><ul><li><p>A hybrid way of working, with some days each week in our Utrecht office and the rest from home.</p></li><li><p>A free NS train card, so you can travel across the Netherlands for work and in your free time.</p></li><li><p>A free Interrail Pass every year for you and a companion, so you can travel across Europe the way our travellers do.</p></li><li><p>Unlimited access to OpenUp, an online wellbeing platform.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">A personal wellbeing allowance of up to €1,500.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">A training allowance of up to €4,000 for learning that’s relevant to your role.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">A variable annual bonus (target 4%), based on company and individual performance.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>An annual team trip across Europe, so you see first-hand what our travellers experience.</p></li><li><p>The option to work from abroad for 20 days a year.</p></li><li><p>An annual leave package of 28 days, plus study days, volunteer days and a culture day.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Salary Scale: 60. Monthly gross salary (excluding 8% holiday allowance): €5,300 – €6,400 (full-time), based on experience.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Curious to apply?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Apply directly through our <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.interrail.com/careers">careers page</a></u>.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>We’ll ask you to share your CV in English (our business language) and tell us why you’re interested in Interrail and this role. It doesn’t hurt to be creative; we enjoy seeing your personality shine through.</p></li><li><p>For some roles, we may also ask you to complete a short task based on the real job, so you can show us your skills in practice.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">If we’d like to get to know you better, the next step is a first conversation with Talent Acquisition, followed by interviews with the team. It’s a two-way conversation: a chance for you to explore Interrail, and for us to get to know you.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">To keep our hiring fair, we use blind screening in the early stages. Your name, photo, date of birth, gender, nationality, contact details and social media links are hidden, so our first decisions are based only on your skills, experience and potential.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>In the meantime</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">If you’re curious, why not check us out on <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/interrailbv/life/db58e986-bae9-4b1f-9211-e8c7bdfd0b7e/?viewAsMember=true">LinkedIn</a></u> and get a sense of our culture and values?</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Got questions? Our team would be happy to help: just drop us a note at <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- We don’t reply to messages on LinkedIn, so email is the best way to reach us.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">While you’re here, you can plan your own trip and find your Pass at <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="http://www.interrail.com">www.interrail.com</a>.</p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/interrail-bv/senior-seo-geo-manager-utrecht-57850","tags":["Growth"],"job_types":["Senior manager","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Utrecht , Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1795566698},{"slug":"senior-search-and-conversion-writer-utrecht-337710","company_name":"Interrail B.V.","title":"Senior Search and Conversion Writer","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Who we are</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">We believe travel can create Citizens of the World. When people cross Europe slowly, by train, they come back more curious, more open and better able to understand people unlike themselves.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">With colleagues from more than 50 countries, our diversity sparks curiosity, insight and a culture of openness, which is essential to understanding our travellers and one another.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Three values connect everyone at Interrail: we lead with our purpose, we own our impact, and we choose for growth.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">We work in a hybrid way, from our office in Utrecht and our homes across the Netherlands.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Who we’re looking for</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Every Interrail trip starts with a question: "Where should I go in October?", "Can I see the Alps by train?", "How does the Pass actually work?". We're looking for someone who will make sure <strong>Interrail </strong>is the best answer, wherever it's asked: Google, AI assistants or a paid search ad.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">You'll write the guides, itineraries and how-tos that bring travellers to us, and the search ads and landing pages that turn their curiosity into a Pass. Most of your time (around 70%) goes into organic and AI search content. The rest goes into paid search copy and landing pages, where the two worlds meet.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">You'll sit in our Creatives &amp; Content team and work day-to-day with our SEO Specialist, Paid Media, CRO, CRM and UX colleagues.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Also,<strong><em> </em></strong>it's good to know that the team has agreed to meet in the office every Tuesday and Thursday, therefore you will be expected to be in the office on these days to work side by side with your colleagues.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What you’ll be doing</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">You’ll be joining the Creatives and Content team, a friendly group of writers, designers, videographers, content managers and other creatives<em>,</em> and reporting to our Managing Editor.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal">You’ll be involved in:</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Organic and AI search content</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Turn our SEO and GEO keyword and topic strategy into an editorial plan, from inspirational queries ("underrated Greek islands") to high-intent ones ("how to plan an Interrail trip").</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Use customer research, on-site search and questions shared with Customer Service to identify content gaps, understand traveller concerns and improve how we explain the Pass.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Write and edit destination guides, route pages, itineraries, how-tos and Pass explainers that rank, get cited by AI assistants and move readers closer to travelling.&nbsp; Publish content months ahead of demand peaks.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Work with internal experts, rail partners and travellers to develop first-hand advice, practical examples and original stories that give people a reason to choose Interrail content.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Balance the obvious mobility topics (routes, destinations, practical planning) with consideration of our purpose and belief in The Interrail Effect: how travelling Europe with a rail Pass way changes how you see the world, and why only Interrail can say it.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Structure content so both people and machines can use it: answer-first paragraphs, clear heading hierarchy, FAQs, factual and quotable answers for AI Overviews and assistants.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Own on-page copy (titles, meta descriptions, slugs, alt text, internal anchors) and brief schema needs to the Senior SEO &amp; GEO Manager.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Refresh, consolidate or retire decaying and overlapping pages, using the audits run with the Senior SEO &amp; GEO Manager.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Verify routes, reservation requirements, Pass conditions and other practical details with the relevant teams, and keep published advice up to date.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Conversion copy</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Write paid search copy (Google and Microsoft responsive search ads, Performance Max text assets) built on the same search intent as our organic content.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Write landing pages that serve paid and organic traffic, keeping ad, page and offer in one consistent message, and supply copy variants for tests run by CRO and Paid Media.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><strong>Collaboration and ways of working</strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Make editorial recommendations about what to create, improve, combine or stop, balancing customer needs, commercial value and available capacity.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Create the search message framework (core value propositions, proof points, tone by journey stage) that campaign copywriters use for paid social, display and CRM.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Review content performance and copy-test results with SEO, Paid Media and CRO, and apply the findings to future briefs, messaging and updates.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Use AI tools to speed up research, outlines and ad variants, while owning accuracy, voice and the human perspective in everything published.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Develop a keen understanding of the Interrail brand and The Interrail Effect, embedding it into all SEO, SEA and GEO efforts. Optimise content for search while reinforcing our purpose.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What success looks like</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>After 6 months</em></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Priority topic clusters for the next two seasonal peaks are planned, written and/or refreshed, and live ahead of demand.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">A shared search message framework is in use by Paid Media and the campaign copywriters.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">A baseline for AI-search visibility (citations in AI Overviews and assistants for priority queries) is set with the Senior SEO &amp; GEO Manager.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>After 12 months</em></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Measurable growth in organic sessions and Pass conversions from content in priority clusters [targets to be set with Growth team].</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Improved AI-search visibility for priority queries against the baseline.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Measurable lift in paid search CTR and landing page conversion from copy tests [targets to be set with Paid Media and CRO]. &nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>What we’re looking for</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Here’s what will help you in this role.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">In terms of your experience and skills:</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>Must-haves</em></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">6+ years writing SEO content, with organic growth you can show on a large, content-led site.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">A portfolio with both long-form search content and paid search ads, plus the results behind them.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Strong grasp of search intent, topic clusters, on-page SEO, E-E-A-T and content refresh strategy.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Experience adapting content for AI search, with a clear approach to testing, evaluating results and applying what you learn.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Experience writing within ad platform limits and learning from copy tests.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Understanding of how to leverage AI responsibly and efficiently in the context of a role like this one.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Range: Ability to go from writing an evocative destination story to a 30-character headline in the same afternoon, in flawless English.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Ability to work collaboratively across teams (including with fellow creatives, paid channel owners and beyond) while owning individual impact.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Strong editorial judgement: you can identify a useful angle, substantiate it and write in a distinctive brand voice without relying on clichés or generic travel language.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>Nice-to-haves</em></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Experience in travel, hospitality or lifestyle industry</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Experience with Semrush or Ahrefs, Google Search Console, GA4 and Google Ads.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Experience writing for multiple markets or briefing localisation.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">Fluency in one or more of our main market languages, such as Dutch or German</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Experience exploring Europe by train &nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Our offer</strong></p><ul><li><p>A hybrid way of working, with some days each week in our Utrecht office and the rest from home.</p></li><li><p>A free NS train card, so you can travel across the Netherlands for work and in your free time.</p></li><li><p>A free Interrail Pass every year for you and a companion, so you can travel across Europe the way our travellers do.</p></li><li><p>Unlimited access to OpenUp, an online wellbeing platform.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">A personal wellbeing allowance of up to €1,500.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">A training allowance of up to €4,000 for learning that’s relevant to your role.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">A variable annual bonus (target 4%), based on company and individual performance.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>An annual team trip across Europe, so you see first-hand what our travellers experience.</p></li><li><p>The option to work from abroad for 20 days a year.</p></li><li><p>An annual leave package of 28 days, plus study days, volunteer days and a culture day.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal">Salary scale 59: Monthly gross salary (excluding 8% holiday allowance): €4,400 – €5,500 (full-time), based on experience.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Curious to apply?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Apply directly through our <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.interrail.com/careers">careers page</a></u>.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p>We’ll ask you to share your CV in English (our business language) and tell us why you’re interested in Interrail and this role. It doesn’t hurt to be creative; we enjoy seeing your personality shine through.</p></li><li><p>For some roles, we may also ask you to complete a short task based on the real job, so you can show us your skills in practice.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">If we’d like to get to know you better, the next step is a first conversation with Talent Acquisition, followed by interviews with the team. It’s a two-way conversation: a chance for you to explore Interrail, and for us to get to know you.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">To keep our hiring fair, we use blind screening in the early stages. Your name, photo, date of birth, gender, nationality, contact details and social media links are hidden, so our first decisions are based only on your skills, experience and potential.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>In the meantime</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">If you’re curious, why not check us out on <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/interrailbv/life/db58e986-bae9-4b1f-9211-e8c7bdfd0b7e/?viewAsMember=true">LinkedIn</a></u> and get a sense of our culture and values?</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Got questions? Our team would be happy to help: just drop us a note at <u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- We don’t reply to messages on LinkedIn, so email is the best way to reach us.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">While you’re here, you can plan your own trip and find your Pass at <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="http://www.interrail.com">www.interrail.com</a>.</p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/interrail-bv/senior-search-and-conversion-writer-utrecht-337710","tags":["Creatives & Content"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Utrecht , Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1795566698},{"slug":"stagiaire-social-media-creative-ede-429425","company_name":"Berg Toys","title":"Stagiair(e) Social Media Creative","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#333333">Stagiair(e) Social Media Creative</span></span></em></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#D71920">32-40&nbsp;uur</span></span></em></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Ben jij iemand die graag creatief bezig is, helemaal thuis is op social media en het leuk vindt om met de nieuwste trends aan de slag te gaan? Vind je het leuk om video's te maken en te editen, nieuwe ideeën te bedenken en content te creëren die écht opvalt? Dan zoeken wij jou!</p><p class="MsoNormal">Bij BERG krijg je de ruimte om jouw creativiteit volop in te zetten. Je draait echt mee in ons team en krijgt de vrijheid om zelf ideeën aan te dragen, content te maken en projecten op te pakken. Geen stage waarbij je alleen meekijkt, maar een plek waar je zelf aan de slag gaat, veel leert en jouw ideeën werkelijkheid ziet worden. Samen maken we er een creatieve en vooral leuke stage van!</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#404547">Create your&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#D71920">FUTURE</span></span></em></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Als stagiair(e) Multi Media Design word jij onderdeel van ons creatieve Social Media team binnen de Branding afdeling. Je krijgt de ruimte om jouw creativiteit te laten zien en werkt mee aan allerlei gave projecten. Van social media content tot 360 campagnes: jij helpt mee om BERG op een creatieve manier onder de aandacht te brengen.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<strong><span style="font-size:1.2em">Wat ga je zoal doen?</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Je bedenkt, ontwerpt en maakt toffe content voor onze social media kanalen.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Je gaat aan de slag met videomontage en grafisch ontwerp, van pakkende reels tot opvallende visuals.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Je helpt onze social media kanalen dagelijks up-to-date te houden.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Je ondersteunt bij influencer samenwerkingen en denkt mee over creatieve mogelijkheden.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Je werkt samen met ons creatieve team aan video- en designprojecten.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Je helpt mee aan onze 360 graden campagnes en krijgt een kijkje achter de schermen bij verschillende marketingactiviteiten.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">En het leukste? Er is volop ruimte voor jouw eigen ideeën en creatieve input! Zie jij een trend voorbijkomen die perfect bij BERG past? Of heb je een origineel idee voor een video? Laat maar zien!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#404547">100%&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#D71920">YOU</span></span><span style="color:#404547"><br></span></em></strong>Jij bent iemand die niet alleen graag creatief bezig is, maar ook niet bang is om initiatief te nemen. Je hebt gevoel voor design, weet wat er speelt op social media en krijgt energie van het maken van content die echt opvalt.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Je vindt het leuk om samen te werken, maar kunt ook prima zelfstandig aan de slag. Je schakelt makkelijk tussen verschillende projecten, denkt graag mee en houdt ervan om nieuwe dingen te leren.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Daarnaast ben jij een enthousiaste tweede- of derdejaars hbo-student Communication &amp; Multimedia Design (of een vergelijkbare opleiding).</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Herken jij jezelf hierin? Dan zijn we op zoek naar jou!</strong></p><ul><li><p>Je hebt een social first mindset en weet wat werkt op Instagram, TikTok en andere kanalen.</p></li><li><p>Je bent creatief, proactief en komt graag met nieuwe ideeën.</p></li><li><p>Je hebt gevoel voor grafisch design en maakt graag opvallende content.</p></li><li><p>Je hebt ervaring met Adobe Creative Cloud (o.a. Premiere Pro, After Effects, Photoshop en Illustrator).</p></li><li><p>Je volgt de nieuwste trends op het gebied van social media, design en AI.</p></li><li><p>Je werkt nauwkeurig, hebt oog voor detail en kunt goed omgaan met deadlines.</p></li><li><p>Je spreekt en schrijft goed Nederlands en Engels.</p></li><li><p>Je hebt een portfolio met werk waar je trots op bent!</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je hoeft natuurlijk nog niet alles te kunnen. Je komt tenslotte bij ons om te leren! Enthousiasme, creativiteit en de drive om jezelf te ontwikkelen vinden we minstens zo belangrijk</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br><strong><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#404547">WHAT’S IN IT FOR&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#D71920">YOU?</span></span><span style="color:#D71920"><br></span></em></strong>Een stage bij BERG is allesbehalve saai! Je krijgt de kans om jezelf zowel creatief als professioneel te ontwikkelen, wordt onderdeel van een gezellig team en werkt aan projecten die je straks met trots aan je portfolio kunt toevoegen.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Natuurlijk krijg je goede begeleiding, maar ook genoeg vrijheid om zelf dingen te ontdekken en initiatief te nemen. En ja, daar hoort ook een fijne stagevergoeding bij!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;<strong>Wat kun je van ons verwachten?</strong></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Stagevergoeding €450,- per maand (o.b.v. 40 uur)</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een stage van minimaal 5 maanden, vanaf februari 2027.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een creatieve, inspirerende werkomgeving met enthousiaste en gezellige collega's.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Veel afwisseling: van video's editen tot social content ontwerpen en meedenken over campagnes.&nbsp;Geen dag is hetzelfde!</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; De kans om echt mee te werken aan projecten en jouw ideeën tot leven te brengen.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Goede begeleiding en volop ruimte om nieuwe skills te ontwikkelen.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Gezellige lunches, potjes tafeltennis of tafelvoetbal én natuurlijk de mogelijkheid om zelf onze trampolines uit te proberen!</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ruimte om aan een eigen stageopdracht te werken.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;Kortom: een plek waar je veel leert, nieuwe uitdagingen aangaat en waar hard werken en plezier maken prima samengaan!</p><p class="MsoNormal"><br><strong><em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#333333">GA JIJ DE UITDAGING</span><span style="color:#D71920"> AAN?</span></span></em></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Stel je aan ons voor door te solliciteren op deze vacature door hier te klikken.<br><br>Heb je nu al brandende vragen over de stageopdrachten en/of het werken bij BERG? Neem contact op met Liset Bloem (HR) door te bellen naar +31 (0) 318 46 7171. Of neem alvast een kijkje op onze website voor meer informatie over BERG op www.berg.com/nl<br><br>Acquisitie naar aanleiding van deze advertentie wordt niet op prijs gesteld.<br>Een tip voor een nieuwe collega is altijd welkom!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <b